The Extra Change (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100151

Rohan went to a shop to buy a notebook.

He gave the shopkeeper some money.

The shopkeeper returned the change.

Rohan walked a few steps and checked the money.

He noticed he had received extra coins.

Rohan stopped.

He thought, “I can keep this money… or return it.”

He went back to the shop.

“Uncle, you gave me extra money,” he said.

The shopkeeper checked and smiled.

“Thank you for being honest,” he said.

He gave Rohan a small chocolate.

Rohan felt happy.

He knew he had done the right thing.

💖 Moral:

Honesty brings true happiness.
